{"recordId":"emperor_唐武宗_285894310","name":"唐武宗","type":"emperor","dynasty":"唐朝","title":"會昌天子","canonicalName":null,"aliases":[],"identityStatus":"candidate","candidatePages":[{"title":"唐武宗","pageId":43272,"revisionId":92258928,"revisionTimestamp":"2026-04-12T13:18:09Z","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%94%90%E6%AD%A6%E5%AE%97","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92258928","wikidataId":"Q9801","isDisambiguation":false,"bibliography":[{"citationTitle":"舊唐書","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"資治通鑑","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"鉴诫录","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"九转验","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"实录","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"大事记续编","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"宣宗实录","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"永乐大典（残卷）·[http://www.guoxue123.com/other/yldd/yldd4/025.htm 卷之二万四百七十八]","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"卷之二万四百七十八","url":"http://www.guoxue123.com/other/yldd/yldd4/025.htm","type":"reference-link","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"全唐文 卷0076","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"內則","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"旧唐书","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"旧唐书 本纪第十八上 武宗","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"唐会要·卷二十一·列传第二十一","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"新唐书·诸帝公主列传","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"《新唐书·诸帝公主列传》","url":"http://guoxue.baidu.com/page/d0c2ccc6cae9/95.html","type":"reference-link","locator":"reference or bibliography section"}],"wikisourceLinks":[],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:39:01.350Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:jinshi","source:songshi"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:jinshi-22a9a540c7f5486f","query":"唐武宗","count":1,"offset":954,"excerpt":"十而取一，不亦少乎？」對曰：「此輩浮食，無益有損，不宜滋益也。」上曰：「周武帝、唐武宗、後周世宗皆賢君，其壽不永，雖曰偶然，似亦有因也。」對曰：「三君矯枉太過。今不毀除、不崇奉，是為得中矣。」是歲，郊見上帝焉。\n\n　　頃之，翰林修撰路鐸論胥持國不","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:songshi-833f234f635712cd","query":"唐武宗","count":1,"offset":2555,"excerpt":"皆有配坐，每室一帝一後，禮之正儀。唐開元中，昭成、肅明二後始並祔於睿宗。今惟演引唐武宗母韋太后升祔穆宗，本朝孝明、孝章禘太祖故事。按穆宗惟韋后祔，太祖未嘗以孝章配。伏尋先帝以懿德配享太宗，及明德園陵禮畢，遂得升祔。元德太后自追尊後，凡十七年始克升","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:songshi-52f5f2fd5e1ed925","query":"唐武宗","count":1,"offset":1616,"excerpt":"）〕《唐敬宗實錄》十卷〔（李讓夷等撰）〕《唐文宗實錄》四十卷〔（魏謩修撰。）〕《唐武宗實錄》二十卷\n\n《唐宣宗實錄》三十卷《唐懿宗實錄》二十五卷《唐僖宗實錄》三十卷《唐昭宗實錄》三十卷\n\n《唐哀帝實錄》八卷〔（並宋敏求撰）〕《五代梁太祖實錄》三十","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:songshi-214a193e102b874e","query":"唐武宗","count":1,"offset":5232,"excerpt":"禮部侍郎。\n\n敏求家藏書三萬卷，皆略誦習，熟於朝廷典故，士大夫疑議，必就正焉。補唐武宗以下《六世實錄》百四十八卷，它所著書甚多，學者多諮之。嘗建言：「河北、陝西、河東舉子，性樸茂，而辭藻不工，故登第者少。請令轉運使擇薦有行藝材武者，特官之，使人材","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:songshi-f4c2abbf824c5f39","query":"唐武宗","count":1,"offset":6139,"excerpt":"致意縝密，時輩咸推服之。及掌誥命，頗繁富冗長，不達體要，無稱職之譽。\n\n常欲追補唐武宗以來實錄，孜孜訪求遺事，殆廢寢食，會疾革，唯以書未成為恨。至淳化中，參知政事蘇易簡因言及鄰幾追補《唐實錄》事，鄰幾一子東之，以蔭補郎山主簿，部送軍糧詣北邊，沒焉","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":5,"gaps"